  {
    "id": "e3c6aec2-e965-4d06-bc82-311dbd856502",
    "users": [
      "1d1bfb2a-6155-41a8-a3d5-7a40f730a47c",
      "92ed8af0-98bb-4e17-a815-d02583304cf8"
    ],
    "status": "accepted",
    "messages": [
      {
        "from": "1d1bfb2a-6155-41a8-a3d5-7a40f730a47c",
        "content": "Hi Adv. Sarah, I have a quick question about filing a copyright registration for a mobile app source code.",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-21T07:51:41.151747Z"
      },
      {
        "from": "92ed8af0-98bb-4e17-a815-d02583304cf8",
        "content": "Hello! Copyright protection for software covers source code and object code under Indian Copyright Act, 1957. You'll need to submit the first and last 20 pages of the source code.",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-21T08:51:41.151747Z"
      },
      {
        "from": "1d1bfb2a-6155-41a8-a3d5-7a40f730a47c",
        "content": "Thank you! What is the estimated timeline for registration approval?",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-21T10:51:41.151747Z"
      },
      {
        "from": "92ed8af0-98bb-4e17-a815-d02583304cf8",
        "content": "Standard processing takes around 3 to 6 months including mandatory 30-day objection window. Let me know if you need help drafting the application.",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-21T11:51:41.151747Z"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "bb671a06-f57f-443a-9552-6ee2f63a76ad",
    "users": [
      "1d1bfb2a-6155-41a8-a3d5-7a40f730a47c",
      "a5edb4c1-f61f-4688-918d-d54e9f314674"
    ],
    "status": "accepted",
    "messages": [
      {
        "from": "1d1bfb2a-6155-41a8-a3d5-7a40f730a47c",
        "content": "Good evening Sir, what are the key legal formalities for registering a partnership firm in Delhi?",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-20T05:51:41.151747Z"
      },
      {
        "from": "a5edb4c1-f61f-4688-918d-d54e9f314674",
        "content": "Good evening! You'll need a notarized Partnership Deed, PAN card for the firm, address proof, and filing Form 1 with Registrar of Firms.",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-20T06:51:41.151747Z"
      },
      {
        "from": "1d1bfb2a-6155-41a8-a3d5-7a40f730a47c",
        "content": "Got it! Is registration mandatory or optional under Indian Partnership Act?",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-20T07:51:41.151747Z"
      },
      {
        "from": "a5edb4c1-f61f-4688-918d-d54e9f314674",
        "content": "It is optional, but highly recommended because an unregistered firm cannot enforce contract claims against third parties in court.",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-20T09:51:41.151747Z"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
